From: Pharma360 QA Team
Subject: [PATCH 004 CORRECTED] Fix frontend healthcheck and port mapping
Date: 2026-11-01

This CORRECTED patch fixes:
1. Frontend port mapping: was 3000:80, should be 8080:8080 (frontend.conf listens on 8080)
2. Frontend healthcheck: wget not available in nginx-unprivileged, use curl instead

---
 docker/docker-compose.yml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docker/docker-compose.yml b/docker/docker-compose.yml
index abc1234..def5678 100644
--- a/docker/docker-compose.yml
+++ b/docker/docker-compose.yml
@@ -93,11 +93,11 @@ services:
     depends_on:
       pharma360-backend:
         condition: service_healthy
     ports:
-      - "${FRONTEND_PORT:-3000}:80"
+      - "${FRONTEND_PORT:-8080}:8080"
     networks:
       - pharma360-network
     healthcheck:
-      test: ["CMD", "wget", "--no-verbose", "--tries=1", "--spider", "http://localhost/"]
+      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "curl -f http://localhost:8080/ || exit 1"]
       interval: 30s
       timeout: 10s
       retries: 3
       start_period: 15s
---
To apply this patch:
  cd /workspace/github__DuDuEZN__Pharma-360
  patch -p1 < patches/004-CORRECTED-fix-frontend-healthcheck-and-ports.patch

OR manually apply:
  1. Edit docker/docker-compose.yml
  2. Change line 96: - "${FRONTEND_PORT:-3000}:80" -> - "${FRONTEND_PORT:-8080}:8080"
  3. Change line 100: test: ["CMD", "wget", "--no-verbose", "--tries=1", "--spider", "http://localhost/"]
     -> test: ["CMD-SHELL", "curl -f http://localhost:8080/ || exit 1"]
